  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed: an image served with its Content-Type header twice was embedded broken and failed the capture with a bare [object Event] in Chromium engines. .NET MAUI's BlazorWebView does this on Android for every static file, so any capture containing one of the app's own images failed there. The vendored html-to-image 1.11.13 carries the upstream fix https://github.com/bubkoo/html-to-image/pull/602 until a release contains it.",
